EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY getimage

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

#LINK_NAME Sample Config File
#LINK getimage.d.txt

#LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
#LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>getimage</b> is a simple program for
retrieving and deleting GIF images.  
It is called via a webserver, with a
GIF filename.  It opens the GIF file, writes its
contents back to the webserver, and then deletes
the file.  The program is for use with dynamically
generated GIF images(such as getlist/eqparam2html
maps), where the map needs to be passed to the
webclient, and then deleted so that old maps do not
overrun the webserver.
<br><br>
Initial version  davidk 1999
